IR Content:
```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: pg8000-sqli
  kind: taint
  severity: WARNING
  message: "Detected string concatenation with a non-literal variable in a pg8000 Python SQL statement. This could lead to SQL injection if the variable is user-controlled and not properly sanitized. In order to prevent SQL injection, use parameterized queries or prepared statements instead."
  metadata:
    language: python
    category: security
    references:
      - https://github.com/tlocke/pg8000
    cwe:
      - "CWE-89: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command ('SQL Injection')"
    owasp:
      - A01:2017 - Injection
      - A03:2021 - Injection

sources:
  - id: USER_INPUT
    match:
      node: IDENTIFIER
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: name
          right: ".*USERINPUT.*"

sinks:
  - id: SQL_EXEC
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        package: pg8000
        type: Connection
        method: run|execute|executemany|prepare
      arg_index: 1
    where:
      - op: neq
        left: arg[1].type
        right: "string"

sanitizers:
  - id: PARAMETERIZED_QUERY
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        package: pg8000
        type: Connection
        method: run|execute|executemany|prepare
      arg_index: 1
    where:
      - op: eq
        left: arg[1].type
        right: "string"
    effect: neutralize

propagations:
  - id: STRING_CONCAT
    edge: DFG
    kind: taint
    where:
      - op: regex
        left: source.value
        right: ".*\\+.*|.*\\..*format\\(.*\\).*|.*%.*\\(.*\\).*|.*f'.*\\{.*\\}.*'.*"
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "sources 节点定义不完整，原始规则中检测的污染源包括字符串连接、格式化字符串等多种方式，而当前 IR 仅定义了 USERINPUT 标识符"
  - "建议修改 sources 定义，增加对字符串连接、格式化操作等源节点的匹配"
  - "sanitizers 节点定义过于宽泛，原始规则中只有特定格式的参数化查询才是合法的净化器"
  - "建议修改 sanitizers 的 where 条件，确保只有当参数是纯字符串字面量时才作为有效的净化器"
  - "propagations 节点的正则表达式匹配模式需要优化，以更准确地反映原始规则中的字符串操作模式"
```
